{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"chain_link","model_identifier":"chain_link","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# chain_link\n\nChain link: a single small iron link (3 u long), repeated by the game along the line behind `chain_hook`. Alternate links are turned 90 degrees about Z.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -1..1, y -0..0, z -2..2 units (0.06 x 0.02 x 0.08 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 4.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 2 x 1 x 3 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Notes\n\n- Origin at the centre; spacing along the chain 2.5 u.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"side_l","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,-0.3,-1.5],"to":[-0.5,0.3,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8.0,0.7,8.5,1.3],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[2.5,0.7,5.5,1.3],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8.0,0.7,8.5,1.3],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[2.5,0.7,5.5,1.3],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,0.5,0.5,3.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,0.5,0.5,3.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4132f18c-b0f5-58e9-bc41-5887b9289acf"},{"name":"side_r","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[0.5,-0.3,-1.5],"to":[1.0,0.3,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[9.5,0.7,10.0,1.3],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[2.5,0.7,5.5,1.3],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[9.5,0.7,10.0,1.3],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[2.5,0.7,5.5,1.3],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[1.5,0.5,2.0,3.5